# v1.4.0 - Instant FTS5 Search, Balanced Track Recommendation Engine & Zero-Delay Auto-Sync Cache Busting

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Major Release**: Introducing SQLite FTS5 Full-Text Search for ultra-fast lyrics searching, automated database synchronization triggers, a rebalanced track recommendation and catalog discovery algorithm, real-time auto-sync store on frontend, and version-based cache busting for audio and cover art that completely eliminates manual Cloudflare R2 purges.

---

## 1. Instant FTS5 Lyrics Search & Single-Shot Query Engine (`lament-api`)

Re-architected the search backend to support high-performance full-text search across titles, artists, and lyrics:

- **SQLite FTS5 Virtual Table (`lyrics_fts`)**:
  - Created dedicated virtual table `CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE lyrics_fts USING fts5(track_id UNINDEXED, content)`.
  - Built an inverted index across all 463 song lyrics in the Turso database.
  - Replaced $O(N)$ sequential full-table scans (`LIKE %query%` which took 1.5s–2.3s) with $O(\log K)$ B-Tree token lookups via `lyrics_fts MATCH ?`.
  - Database search latency dropped from **>2000ms down to ~15ms – 100ms**.
- **Automated Database Triggers**:
  - Created `lyrics_ai` (AFTER INSERT), `lyrics_au` (AFTER UPDATE), and `lyrics_ad` (AFTER DELETE) triggers directly inside Turso DB. Any new song scraped or lyrics updated automatically sync to `lyrics_fts` without manual scripts.
- **Single-Shot Batch Roundtrip (`db.batch([...], 'read')`)**:
  - Consolidated tracks, albums, and artists into 1 single HTTP request to Turso Cloud (Tokyo), eliminating 4 sequential internet roundtrips.
  - Integrated `json_group_array` to resolve artist relations in a single query without cartesian join multiplication.
- **In-Memory Fuzzy Artist Cache (sub-1ms)**:
  - Cached all database artists in server memory with a 5-minute TTL, executing Levenshtein typo-tolerant matching in pure RAM.
- **Frontend Optimization (`SearchModal.svelte`)**:
  - Integrated `AbortController` to cancel in-flight HTTP requests when the user types quickly.
  - Added in-memory session cache (`Map<string, SearchResult>`) for instantaneous 0ms repeat searches.
  - Tuned debounce delay to 200ms.

---

## 2. Rebalanced Catalog Discovery & Recommendation Algorithm (`lament-api`)

Resolved the severe catalog imbalance where Indonesian tracks dominated discovery despite the database being 77% Western music:

- **Indonesian Classifier Refinement (`isIndonesianTrack`)**:
  - Fixed false-positive classifications caused by short word substrings (e.g. "ran" matching inside "Ariana Grande").
  - Implemented exact multi-word phrase matching and tokenized word boundary matching.
  - Accurately segmented the active database: 127 Indonesian tracks (23%) vs 421 Western/International tracks (77%).
- **Balanced Catalog Discovery (`listTracks`)**:
  - Interleaving ratio: **3 Western : 2 Indonesian** to reflect actual catalog proportions without burying Western tracks under Indonesian ones.
- **Context-Aware Recommendations (`getRecommendations`)**:
  - When playing Western music: recommendations are biased 75% Western + 25% Indonesian.
  - When playing Indonesian music: recommendations are biased 75% Indonesian + 25% Western.
- **Trending & Most Played Endpoints**:
  - Implemented `/tracks/trending` (blending play count and recency) and `/tracks/most-played`.

---

## 3. Real-Time Auto-Sync & Cache Busting (`lament-api` & `lament`)

Completely eliminated the need to manually purge Cloudflare R2 cache and wait minutes for local browser audio cache to expire:

- **Audio & Image Variant Cache Busting (`processor.ts`)**:
  - `transformAudioUrl` and `formatImageVariants` append `?v=${updated_at}` version query parameters.
  - Whenever track audio or cover art is updated, Cloudflare Edge and browser disk cache treat the file as a new resource immediately.
- **Database Catalog Versioning (`system_meta`)**:
  - Created `system_meta` table storing `catalog_version`.
  - Added database triggers `tracks_catalog_ai`, `tracks_catalog_au`, and `tracks_catalog_ad` to automatically bump `catalog_version` whenever tracks are added, updated, or deleted.
  - Exposed `GET /sync/version` endpoint in `lament-api`.
- **Frontend Auto-Sync Store (`sync.svelte.ts`)**:
  - Polls `/api/sync/version` every 30 seconds and on tab focus (`visibilitychange`).
  - Automatically invalidates client memory cache and `persistentCache`, invokes `invalidateAll()`, and displays a toast notification: *"Katalog musik diperbarui"*.

---

## 4. Architecture Cleanup & De-Hardcoding

- **Dynamic CDN & Base URL Resolvers**:
  - Removed all hardcoded domain strings (`cdn.lament.rynds.my.id`, `https://api.rynds.my.id`) in source code.
  - Replaced with dynamic resolvers using `process.env.R2_PUBLIC_URL`, `process.env.STORAGE_BASE_URL`, and incoming request origins.
- **Repository Hygiene**:
  - Purged temporary benchmark and migration scratch scripts.
  - Maintained complete integrity across all scraper and ingestion tooling in `lament-scrapper`.
